  "name": "M.I.R.A.G.E.: Multimodal Intelligent Rendering & Automated Generation Engine",
  "description": "Deterministic headless synthetic perception dataset generation engine built on Blender bpy and NVIDIA OptiX raytracing for single-GPU workstations (NVIDIA RTX 4060 8GB). Produces synchronized RGB, Float32 metric depth, surface normals, 16-bit instance masks, and 2D/3D bounding boxes with zero-pixel projection drift for R.A.P.T.O.R. and P.R.I.M.E.",
